     "summary": [
      "The user is asking a follow-up question about free cash flow (自由现金流) - what it is and how to calculate it, in two sentences. This is a casual conversational question, no tools needed. Answer in Chinese, two sentences, concise.\n\nFree cash flow (FCF):\n- 自由现金流 = 经营活动现金流净额 − 资本性支出（购建固定资产、无形资产等支付的现金）\n- It measures the cash a company can freely distribute to shareholders/creditors after maintaining and expanding its asset base — the \"real\" money it earns.\n\nTwo sentences:\n\n1. 自由现金流（FCF）= 经营活动产生的现金流净额 − 资本开支（购建固定资产、无形资产等的支出），即公司维持和扩大经营后真正可自由支配的现金。\n2. 它衡量的是公司\"真金白银\"的造血能力——这部分钱可以用来分红、还债或再投资，比利润更难被会计手段美化。"
